This is a small software driver for the R557 capacitive fingerprint 
scanner/sensor, manufactured by GROW (China).

The repository contains the following files:
`r557_driver.c` — the file containing the main source code.
`r557_driver.h` — the primary header file, which should be included 
in your project's `main.h`.
`r557_driver_conf.h` — a configuration file where you can specify the 
UART port (by selecting the name of your `UART_HandleTypeDef` structure 
object), define parameters such as transmission timeouts (for 
`HAL_UART_Transmit`) and packet lengths, and enable debug mode. 
(Note: When debug mode is set to 1, packets are received via 
`HAL_UART_Receive`. This part may need to be rewritten in the future...)